{"name": "Cosmo Cargo", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"244\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028760/extras/b4b67fdc904ceebbb2ea16bb79b9caaa.avif?t=1787325646\" width=\"1560\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"360\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028760/extras/0a56b991eb158a96341877641b68e282.poster.avif?t=1787325646\" width=\"640\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028760/extras/0a56b991eb158a96341877641b68e282.webm?t=1787325646\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028760/extras/0a56b991eb158a96341877641b68e282.mp4?t=1787325646\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The galaxy is in danger! The fearsome Administrators are on a mission to organize the universe as they see fit, and destroy everything they consider disorderly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But there's still hope! A rebel force is preparing to foil their plans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Travel through different sectors and meet amazing aliens who can help you in your fight!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"244\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028760/extras/a0dc514230c58e7cce33600b29e9d2bb.avif?t=1787325646\" width=\"1560\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"360\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028760/extras/5598f56d969ce3f40bcdcd50e622ffa5.poster.avif?t=1787325646\" width=\"640\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028760/extras/5598f56d969ce3f40bcdcd50e622ffa5.webm?t=1787325646\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028760/extras/5598f56d969ce3f40bcdcd50e622ffa5.mp4?t=1787325646\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Items are essential! Buy, trade, find and steal all kinds of wacky items with powerful effects.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combine them aboard your ship to create new synergies, high-powered chain reactions, and satisfying combos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Upgrade</strong> them by collecting copies to unlock new effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Expand your inventory</strong> by clearing cluttered slots to unlock even more possibilities.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"244\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028760/extras/0277c69e4d0332f38336443877ed6756.avif?t=1787325646\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"360\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028760/extras/c578b2a78528a9085901d63af8609dd8.poster.avif?t=1787325646\" width=\"640\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028760/extras/c578b2a78528a9085901d63af8609dd8.webm?t=1787325646\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028760/extras/c578b2a78528a9085901d63af8609dd8.mp4?t=1787325646\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragrap